{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はレッスンだけだったので\n風邪さんを退治すべく、\n1日中毛布にくるまって\n寝ていました(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんなに寝たの久しぶり♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで二度寝できる日ってあんなに\n幸せな気持ちになるんでしょうか（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田blogの携帯の予測変換のとこで\n『ま』が真夏だったのを見て\nへへって嬉しくなってしまった///笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/11/07/5264246/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんいわく、\nこの手のポーズは真夏を\n表現したポーズらしい(･O･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでこれなの？って聞いたら\n『前の手が真夏の太陽で\nその後ろの手が太陽を\n釣ってる様子』だそうです（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんはいつも面白くて\n本当ムードメーカーなんだよね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもかずみんは真夏が\nかずみんにくっつきに行こうとすると\nうわぁ(OωO )って言って\n逃げちゃいます(-ω-；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逃げられると余計やりたく\nなっちゃうんだけどね〜♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/11/07/5264246/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぷくん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして乃木どこ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんがはしゃいでる姿を\nあんな目で見てたとは（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でもビックリです(-ω-；)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばまいやんはこの前\n真夏がレッスンが上手くいかなくて\n元気なかった時にマカロンを\n差し出してくれたの(´°ω°｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげで元気でました♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすがお姉たまや〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/11/07/5264246/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！そして！そんなお姉たまと\n仲良しの松村沙友理〜！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんたに挑戦状やぁ〜〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やられたらやり返す！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"倍返しだ！( +･`ｰ･´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで仕返しも\n倍にさせていただきます（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"内容は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1,まなったんblogならぬ、\nさゆったんblogを書かせる\n(実はこれ結構前から\nやってもらいたかった///)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2,真夏がまっつんに○○をして\n写メを撮る\n(りんごさんの許可が降りれば\n実行予定(-ω-ﾒ))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というものです(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやぁ〜楽しみ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この戦い、\nまっつんファンのみなさまも\n真夏ファンのみなさまも\n必見でございますよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近日の更新のまなったんblogに\n注目ですっ(☆ω☆ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/11/07/5264246/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスソングをたくさん\nウォークマンに入れたい気分...♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、クリスマスツリーも飾って\n家中クリスマスモードに\nしたい気分(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんオススメのクリスマスソング\nあったら教えてくださーい(ﾉ･v･)ﾉ"}],"source":"archive"}